#1700
Immortal Map Room of the Giant Ant Hill~
   The zone is divided into two levels beneath the surface, and a three-level
high mound onto which players must climb to enter the zone.
~
17 cdk 0
S
#1701
Climbing a Giant Ant Hill~
   You stand at the base of a large ant hill approximately 25 feet tall and
60 feet wide at ground level. Composed primarily of soft earth and rock, this
northern slope looks like it's the easiest way to climb to the hill's summit.
~
17 m 10
D0
~
~
0 0 15662
D4
~
~
0 0 1702
S
#1702
Climbing a Giant Ant Hill~
   You have reached what looks like the halfway point - your footprints quite
evident in the soft earthern slope. The journey is quite demanding as your
weight means you sink into the surface with each step. Just below you lies the
base of the hill while a short climb upwards would take you to the hill's
summit.
~
17 m 10
D4
~
~
0 0 1703
D5
~
~
0 0 1701
