#1703
Climbing a Giant Ant Hill~
   You survey the surrounding plains from your elevated position on top of
this large ant hill. A small heard of quagga grazes near the base of the hill
while a jhereg circles slowly overhead, watching your every move. You can
descend down the hill or move along its summit to the east.
~
