#1704
The Entrance to a Giant Ant Hill~
   You peer down into the depths of this ant hill but are greeted with nothing
but darkness. There is an unforgettable sound eminating from beneath the
surface and you could swear you saw something move down there. You may either
enter the ant hill or move towards the west where you can begin your descent.
~
